    board_vulkan_lanes_fabricated_counterpart_output_despite_available_exec_api_2026-08-11, 0, "Real exec APIs exist (io/process_ops.spl, spec/evidence/format/exec_capture.spl both on disk) yet providers still return hardcoded strings"
    board_vulkan_lanes_fabricated_counterpart_output_despite_available_exec_api_2026-08-11, 1, "2026-11-09 lane-p2-2 re-scope: L2 enumeration now runs vulkaninfo via shell() and parses real stdout, failing closed (boundary_enumeration_provider.spl lavapipe_reference_enumeration); L3 readback executes real lavapipe via process_run_bounded (1358b28f0c6); spirv khronos provider uses process_run_bounded. Remaining: L4 provider_inventory.spl still carries out-of-band pinned version/sha256 literals with no host re-verification, and the pinned artifact PATHS were never recorded. blocked-evidence: pinned .so/binary paths + a Linux host with mesa-vulkan-drivers to verify the hashes."

